{"id":"n41289-1-7","stage":4,"title":"낯 · 脸","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41289-1-7-1","ko":"애가 말이 없네요.","zh":"孩子怎么这么安静啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"애가","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"애：孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"2","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말이","meaning":"意思","explanation":"말：意思；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"7","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없네요.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"(谦词)自己的小孩。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"意思","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示再次强调或确认。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某个事实或现象在现实里不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c31d8d397073d78d374a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41289-1-7-2","ko":"우리 아이가 낯을 많이 가리는 편이라서 처음 보는 사람에게 말을 못해요.","zh":"我们的孩子比较怕生，所以见到不认识的人就不敢说话。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이가","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"낯을","meaning":"脸","explanation":"낯：脸；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"낯","audio":"/audio/78686662eab13c8f2b66.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41289","senseId":"1","lemma":"낯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가리는","meaning":"认生","explanation":"가리다：认生；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가리다","audio":"/audio/2015aa077867f9c06e04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17290","senseId":"2","lemma":"가리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편이라서","meaning":"算是","explanation":"편：算是；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"편","audio":"/audio/53cb600fa1af07485c60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71321","senseId":"3","lemma":"편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"처음","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보는","meaning":"见，碰头","explanation":"보다：见，碰头；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람에게","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말을","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"tex